---
description: Testing standards for unit and integration suites
alwaysApply: true
---

# Testing

- Critical logic MUST have automated tests.
- Tests MUST be deterministic.
- Unit tests MUST NOT call the real Telegram API or any exchange API.
- External services MUST be mocked/faked through interfaces/ports.
- Integration tests that need real Telegram MUST be marked `@pytest.mark.integration` and skipped by default.
- Bug fixes MUST include a regression test when practical.
